INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY AND USAGE TERMS

SHER Graphics is the native graphics architecture for SHER Kernel
(https://github.com/Mullassery/SHER-KERNEL), applying the same compatibility
philosophy proven by Aurora (https://github.com/Mullassery/aurora) at the
desktop layer to the graphics subsystem: OpenGL and Vulkan applications run
through Mesa unmodified, while SHER Graphics is free to define its own
native runtime, GPU abstraction, and synchronization model underneath.

